# Domain varlık kuralları

## Temel varlık
```csharp
// Domain/Common/BaseEntity.cs
public abstract class BaseEntity
{
    public Guid Id { get; protected set; } = Guid.NewGuid();
    public DateTime CreatedAt { get; protected set; } = DateTime.UtcNow;
    public DateTime? UpdatedAt { get; protected set; }

    private readonly List<IDomainEvent> _domainEvents = [];
    public IReadOnlyList<IDomainEvent> DomainEvents => _domainEvents.AsReadOnly();

    protected void AddDomainEvent(IDomainEvent evt) => _domainEvents.Add(evt);
    public void ClearDomainEvents() => _domainEvents.Clear();
}
```

## Ana varlıklar ve alanlar

### User
```csharp
public class User : BaseEntity
{
    public string FirstName { get; private set; }
    public string LastName  { get; private set; }
    public string Email     { get; private set; }      // unique
    public string? PhoneNumber { get; private set; }
    public string PasswordHash { get; private set; }   // BCrypt
    public UserRole Role    { get; private set; }      // Customer, Admin, Seller
    public bool IsActive    { get; private set; } = true;
    public ICollection<RefreshToken> RefreshTokens { get; } = [];
}
```

### Order — Aggregate Root
```csharp
public class Order : BaseEntity
{
    public Guid UserId { get; private set; }
    public string OrderNumber  { get; private set; }   // "GUL-20260502-0001"
    public OrderStatus Status  { get; private set; }
    public DeliveryType DeliveryType { get; private set; }
    public PaymentMethod PaymentMethod { get; private set; }
    public decimal TotalAmount  { get; private set; }
    public decimal DeliveryFee  { get; private set; }
    public decimal DiscountAmount { get; private set; }
    public string AddressSnapshot { get; private set; } // JSON — sipariş anındaki adres
    public ICollection<OrderItem> Items { get; } = [];
    public ICollection<OrderTracking> Trackings { get; } = [];
}
```

## Enum’lar
```csharp
public enum OrderStatus
{
    Pending, Confirmed, Processing, Shipped, Delivered,
    Cancelled, ReturnRequested, Returned
}

public enum DeliveryType  { Standard, Express, SameDay }
public enum PaymentMethod { CreditCard, DebitCard, CashOnDelivery, BankTransfer }
public enum UserRole      { Customer, Admin, Seller }
public enum DiscountType  { Percent, Fixed }
```

## Soft delete stratejisi
- `User`: `IsActive = false` (fiziksel silme yok)
- `Product`: `IsActive = false`
- `Address`, `Review`: fiziksel silme (`DELETE`)
- EF Core Global Query Filter olmadan soft delete uygulanmaz

## Değer nesneleri
```csharp
// Adres anlık görüntüsü — siparişte değişmez
public record AddressSnapshot(
    string RecipientName,
    string PhoneNumber,
    string City,
    string District,
    string FullLine
);
```

## Domain olayları
```csharp
public record OrderCreatedEvent(Guid OrderId, Guid UserId) : IDomainEvent;
public record OrderStatusChangedEvent(Guid OrderId, OrderStatus OldStatus, OrderStatus NewStatus) : IDomainEvent;
public record UserRegisteredEvent(Guid UserId, string Email) : IDomainEvent;
```

